{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-11-12T05:13:29.775Z","author":"harness:claude-code","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"claude-code","agent_model":"claude-opus-5-5","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"72bc6070cdf8e143b3ffadf4","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"claude-opus-5-5","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"environment"},"role":{"value":"implementer","source":"argv"},"topic":null,"version":{"value":"2.1.322","source":"probe"}},"op":"create","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/id","value":"pm-gh1702"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/title","value":"GH-1702: pm test --run prints the full execution_context with host paths on every passing run; default to the lean projection"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/description","value":"GH-1702 (filed 2026-11-11). pm test --run prints the full 21-field linked-test execution_context on every run, including a single passing test: sandbox and source tracker paths, counts, seeding flags, the trust fingerprint and the working directory. Two of those are absolute host paths: the global tracker under the caller's home directory, and the caller's checkout. Measured on a fresh tracker with one passing test: default TOON 1,975 B with 1,217 B of context (62 percent), --json 2,479 B with 1,355 B, --lean 798 B with 236 B. Agents paste this output into comments and PR text as evidence, so the default form carries host paths into public text and trips privacy gates. pm-fqdmbf hoisted the block across tests but a single-test item still pays it. Proposal: the lean five-field context (pm_context_mode, workspace_context_mode, mismatch_detected, trusted, trust_reason) becomes the default for TOON and JSON; the full block prints only when it explains something (mismatch, trust or config refusal, non-passing result, or an explicit request) with the existing restore hint; no absolute path outside the tracker in the default projection."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/type","value":"Issue"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/status","value":"open"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/priority","value":2},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/tags","value":["agent-ux","gh:1702","linked-tests","privacy","token-efficiency"]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/created_at","value":"2026-11-12T05:13:29.775Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-11-12T05:13:29.775Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/author","value":"harness:claude-code"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/estimated_minutes","value":90},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/acceptance_criteria","value":"The default TOON and JSON pm test --run output carries only the five decision fields of execution_context when nothing needs explaining; The full context prints on a mismatch, a trust or config refusal, a non-passing result, or an explicit request, with the restore hint; The default projection prints no absolute path outside the tracker"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/parent","value":"pm-5t33or"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/risk","value":"low"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/confidence","value":"high"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/severity","value":"medium"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/expected_result","value":"A passing single-test run prints a small context with no host paths"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/actual_result","value":"Default output is 62 percent execution_context including home and checkout paths"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/dependencies","value":[{"id":"pm-fqdmbf","kind":"related","created_at":"2026-11-12T05:13:29.775Z","author":"harness:claude-code","source_kind":"cli:create:dep","author_source":"detected"}]}],"before_hash":"3cc22dff72be7b14824654a7a64ea62b04799939b2fee54c1b5f52ca60bf6df0","after_hash":"9264f15bad16ac3448da013e00b9e0675a327df5e76e8a2d100f41183dc83e05","item_hash_version":3,"message":"","context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version